me": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1021011425999827", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_1021011429333160_4176289926510597494_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7sRZ10sT0_kQ7kNvwFqG3eA&_nc_oc=AdlTfpmGEdhIZJM3ypv7xnFuvoZm3k76nixziErUUBf8fkvVoS_YnxP0hpqujiNBFuQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv7KENgb_smKzThpRyyZjt8mnnIk_CtZCk7Lr_WnieomQ&oe=69A17EE1"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 4.png", "id": "524012790104112", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001669_524012793437445_4891316513078544414_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jIQx-fxoqK4Q7kNvwFirM_J&_nc_oc=AdmWZocjsqfJYlq9QqlCLlqEoykr7YPGZl7Xj_X0Pg3GT-lCopVwNv7-47SKPP853Vc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvN2e9ZgANlFG-1HMRUj5YxcGMWbrh4SkZBmUSi_GAdxg&oe=69A1935A"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "1187574142495669", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031470_1187574145829002_8495108821353233334_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7kTG1PxiTdMQ7kNvwE1_KKH&_nc_oc=AdkLREbLnhf5nQ2gGSvfQXMf4NUrnqLbrtc1gol1jgARV_yzDBk-EoxOI4h90y0Ot5Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft-TQ3OyRKVBkKh6lArE1x5tR0-j_UNTkbVlJiMtZv43Q&oe=69A185F0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "529809686395654", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476759_529809689728987_2021663405477506286_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=be3JoNsp0j8Q7kNvwFSmO4a&_nc_oc=AdnEe085JUziS2rmo0lj7-Ex2jd0hMMYMiSLLhIvAwH2uKfSBIycxwsm31EMFsZr5Jk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvnLH4Jipes3kwd4QyoqZb3NZeU-gwEti9rAtY01kBMUA&oe=69A177FF"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that allows you to explore cell structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape Mini.png", "id": "2930927027073306", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974477_2930927030406639_1033799740283778117_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F42fHBE5YocQ7kNvwHS4u9U&_nc_oc=AdmSdTvrVUYt8DxRAIGhnH3JUJs0CUaDXvx_OPSNhyy_2ZBv